    {{isim}}, \xF6yle de\u011Fil mi? \U0001F604 Fincan foto\u011Fraflar\u0131n\u0131
    g\xF6r\xFCnce kapt\u0131rd\u0131m kendimi! Detayl\u0131ca analiz ettim yollad\u0131\u011F\u0131n
    foto\u011Fraflar\u0131. Dur dur, ayr\u0131ld\u0131\u011F\u0131n {{data, cinsiyet=erkek,
    k\u0131za | cinsiyet=kad\u0131n, erke\u011Fe | cinsiyet=lgbt, ki\u015Fiye}} dair
    g\xFCzel yans\u0131malar var fal\u0131nda. Anlataca\u011F\u0131m. Ba\u015Flayal\u0131m
    m\u0131?"
